<% content_for :title, "About" %>

<section class="page-header">
  <h1 class="page-title page-title-left">about us</h1>
</section>

<div class="legal-document detail-panel p-4">
  <p>
    Board Base is a platform for virtual bouldering competitions built on the Kilter Board.
    Set routes, invite competitors, and track results on a live leaderboard — all asynchronously,
    from any gym with a Kilter Board.
  </p>
  <p>
    Built by Eric Wang, Ethan Pan, Ishani Pidara, and Hannah Kwak as part of CS-397 at Northwestern University.
  </p>
  <p>
    <%= link_to "View on GitHub", "https://github.com/NU-CS-Software-Studio-Spring-26/project-climbing-competition",
          target: "_blank", rel: "noopener noreferrer", class: "about-github-link" %>
  </p>
</div>
